Claude can accept PDFs and images as input; always send as base64 with correct media_type. PDF: read file as data URL, split off base64, include as {type: "document", source: {type: "base64", media_type: "application/pdf", data}}. Image: {type: "image", source: {type: "base64", media_type: "image/jpeg", data}}.
